<description>&lt;p&gt;Violent clashes continue in Port-au-Prince and Kenscoff as Haitian security forces, now reinforced by a Kenya-led multinational mission, confront Viv Ansanm gangs. The Dominican army has supplied large ammunition stocks to the 400 Mawozo gang, increasing its firepower against the security forces. Erik Prince is operating a private mercenary effort targeting the gangs. The United Nations has allocated an additional US$75 million for life-saving aid to 507,000 people and renewed sanctions on Haiti for another year. The conflict caused 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168598&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxNZjZUQXVjYmZJM3FuMk01bnBGa3pyM0FQV09kY09OeHF1SUZqTGtheDZEaXE5VEViZTVULWs2M1d6QmMzVlZQVWZaX1AzbUFhVUZSXzVsXzV3UGNuQS10QXBhcnJLU2hxdVczTGdITHNwMURUdVd3N1BIM1AwUXgtd3FvaS1EVFZNSGdPTWVxOGJzUzNIZGZIbTRIZTc?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifkFVX3lxTE1PSDNZYklwbFlURFR4ZWw5TXBzM2kxUUV5SEZfZHFESFdkUVU2Q2tKUHZJSzBNeFNGZmlfTUQtb0pzaFJZNllRRjNMajF1RkJBdkNkcGF4aHVabFF4TzNteUhEQWVsazkxMnhJeFdSZVZfekluWW8xZjJSX2VYQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Trinidad Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTE1nQlpTOFRweGo3M2JGQ3dZZkMxU3lZSUN6SkRCNGRodVJhRUdmRU03VTRaVFVPSHJRS3Y3S082dnBEcVphWjh0MUdMRXdfTHBTZ1RNQmp2WXVOZDlZdFdUUTBESDJ5dzdOVGRoeHhjU1FhRnhhT1ZkQ3F1Zmk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Caribbean Life News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxNbjI5THp4WjBiTi1aYjh4b0lOWGdwQXJ0MFNsb3B0bHctOHFfV2Uzc3E1WWpjLUVLSm1HemlrejFtM01ZWW0wS2dzUWhIMXlyNHU2bnh6R1FYTTlSai01azJvTUhPd0tfV0xEd25feVo3am1BRXJ0bXhJYzRpYzlwVXdtdVZkMEtScGUwWFBjZEhvZHRtT0paWnU3WkVIUF9hNGQxdVlaaFctUXdSWmFYcm